('chunk-175','GHBC-CHUNK-000175','GHBC-C-000175','APPROVED FABRICATOR
An established
and qualified person, firm or corporation approved by the Head of Works pursuant to Part 19 of this Code. APPROVED',2,'2.1','APPROVED FABRICATOR','An established',129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000421","GHBC-REQ-000422"]','2a78413ffc0cb4d6be2e41c36b9763bf37e7ca0287a56177b428dd7681d3da82'),
