An independent person, firm or corporation, approved by the Head of Works, who is competent and experienced in the application of engineering principles to materials, methods or systems analyses.',2,'2.1','SOURCE',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000423"]','ebedaab12ee3a20d65b560bd6dc6975136d556736c31f745cdc0e2550849c2bc'),
('chunk-177','GHBC-CHUNK-000177','GHBC-C-000177','AREA, BUILDING
The area included within
surrounding exterior walls, or exterior walls and fire walls, exclusive of vent shafts and courts. Areas of the building not provided with surrounding walls shall be included in the building area if such areas are included within the horizontal projection of the roof or floor above.',2,'2.1','AREA, BUILDING','The area included within',129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000424","GHBC-REQ-000425"]','f0e6a99b9832f4fc2d13a71521714fb7c9e4c95e0dfbbe066a6cd313418e43dc'),
('chunk-178','GHBC-CHUNK-000178','GHBC-C-000178','AREA OF REFUGE
An area where persons
unable to use stairways can remain temporarily to await instructions or assistance during emergency evacuation.',2,'2.1','AREA OF REFUGE','An area where persons',129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000426"]','be5aa311020a657efdf0f2354722359b0d737f3abca353216c6cfe80546d6b45'),
('chunk-179','GHBC-CHUNK-000179','GHBC-C-000179','AREA OF SPORT ACTIVITY
That portion of an indoor or outdoor space where the play or practice of a sport occurs.',2,'2.1','AREA OF SPORT ACTIVITY',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000427"]','d31d7809e7a7ebee3409a4d117d5733ce11863fdfd3be98fd18fe80f62c39c96'),
('chunk-180','GHBC-CHUNK-000180','GHBC-C-000180','AREAWAY
A subsurface space adjacent to a building open at the top or protected at the top by a grating or guard.',2,'2.1','AREAWAY',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000428"]','0e20cbc5a049c8a71e9800c18dd1f09177e309bb7889482f34480f788a9fdbf6');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "chunks" ("id", "chunk_id", "clause_id", "text", "part", "section", "clause", "title", "page", "tables_json", "requirement_ids_json", "source_hash") VALUES ('chunk-181','GHBC-CHUNK-000181','GHBC-C-000181','ATRIUM
An opening connecting two or more
stories other than enclosed stairways, elevators, hoistways, escalators, plumbing, electrical, air-conditioning or other equipment, which is closed at the top and not defined as a mall. Stories, as used in this definition, do not include balconies within assembly groups or mezzanines that comply with this Code.',2,'2.1','ATRIUM','An opening connecting two or more',129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000429","GHBC-REQ-000430"]','f2f1f71d9d2131df0fd8309750cb83c74ea0085da09a2314fa62dd49a56ee94d'),
('chunk-182','GHBC-CHUNK-000182','GHBC-C-000182','ATTIC
The space between the ceiling framing
of the top storey and the underside of the roof. AUDIBLE ALARM NOTIFICATION',2,'2.1','ATTIC','The space between the ceiling framing',129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000431","GHBC-REQ-000432"]','1e1f64f66c44e7c17cb020b778bca23a1e4cc8d031ade4615cfd146939d79af2'),
('chunk-183','GHBC-CHUNK-000183','GHBC-C-000183','APPLIANCE
A notification appliance that alerts by the sense of hearing.',2,'2.1','APPLIANCE',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000433"]','ddcd16b9bede2d1a23de84041106a6d64f50fa8a8a456a54a1f770aae6113ca3'),
('chunk-184','GHBC-CHUNK-000184','GHBC-C-000184','AUTOMATIC
As applied to fire protection
devices, a device or system providing an emergency function without the necessity for human intervention and activated as a result of a predetermined temperature rise, rate of temperature rise or combustion products. AUTOMATIC FIRE-EXTINGUISHING',2,'2.1','AUTOMATIC','As applied to fire protection',129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000434","GHBC-REQ-000435"]','9c4d0f24fdc9426accab2e890f058a5c9bbc6baeb0af345b17f3d8a50ec04633'),
('chunk-185','GHBC-CHUNK-000185','GHBC-C-000185','SYSTEM
An approved system of devices and
equipment which automatically detects a fire and discharges an approved fire-extinguishing agent onto or in the area of a fire.',2,'2.1','SYSTEM',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000436","GHBC-REQ-000437"]','dae93bb2a5010e3364b10e04641cd3348894ec4f4f27ccc9cd6f590c618289bb'),
('chunk-186','GHBC-CHUNK-000186','GHBC-C-000186','AUTOMATIC SMOKE DETECTION SYSTEM
A fire alarm system that has initiation devices that utilize smoke detectors for protection of an area such as a room or space with detectors to provide early warning of fire. AUTOMATIC SPRINKLER',2,'2.1','AUTOMATIC SMOKE DETECTION SYSTEM',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000438","GHBC-REQ-000439"]','45fdedd89c975d7878f9e72fdab33d34551045ed678fb000cc8d7c053cccc16e'),
('chunk-187','GHBC-CHUNK-000187','GHBC-C-000187','SYSTEM
An automatic sprinkler system, for fire protection purposes, is an integrated system of underground and overhead piping designed in accordance with fire protection engineering standards.',2,'2.1','SYSTEM',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000440"]','a4026514e2ed896ed5ca2eb351ee1ab5b810a05e8217e78f3f0c146772d0f451'),
('chunk-188','GHBC-CHUNK-000188','GHBC-C-000188','AUTOMATIC WATER MIST SYSTEM
A system consisting of a water supply, a pressure source and a distribution piping system with attached nozzles, which, at or above a minimum operating pressure defined by its listing, discharges water in fine droplets meeting the requirements of Ghana Fire Code for the purpose of the control, suppression or extinguishment of a fire. Such systems include wet-pipe, dry-pipe and preaction types. The systems are designed as engineered, preengineered, local-application or totalflooding systems.',2,'2.1','AUTOMATIC WATER MIST SYSTEM',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000441","GHBC-REQ-000442","GHBC-REQ-000443"]','cbbb1f687c35cc46313d0e2820d094d55cacc0a310d4b5f622f8007616b48602'),
('chunk-189','GHBC-CHUNK-000189','GHBC-C-000189','AVERAGE AMBIENT SOUND LEVEL
The root mean square, A-weighted sound pressure level measured over a 24-hour period, or the time any person is present, whichever time period is less.',2,'2.1','AVERAGE AMBIENT SOUND LEVEL',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000444"]','cb433107fc412577bbe75bef413dcb47e3636be0278424571613aca54ccfe1d7'),
('chunk-190','GHBC-CHUNK-000190','GHBC-C-000190','AWNING
An architectural projection that provides weather protection, identity or decoration and is partially or wholly supported by the building to which it is attached. An awning is comprised of a lightweight frame structure over which a covering is attached.',2,'2.1','AWNING',NULL,129,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000445","GHBC-REQ-000446"]','70e3b6bab694af534b64c2a00da70d6db37ce46c7c6623df16ddba736b41d20e');
