('chunk-200','GHBC-CHUNK-000200','GHBC-C-000200','BRACED WALL LINE
A straight line through
the building plan that represents the location of the lateral resistance provided by the wall bracing.',2,'2.1','BRACED WALL LINE','A straight line through',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000463"]','c47cb68da5368a30fa5e790a182c5b7d2a271b680e8277d37152f63c447c0363');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "chunks" ("id", "chunk_id", "clause_id", "text", "part", "section", "clause", "title", "page", "tables_json", "requirement_ids_json", "source_hash") VALUES ('chunk-201','GHBC-CHUNK-000201','GHBC-C-000201','BRACED WALL PANEL
A full-height clause
of wall constructed to resist in-plane shear loads through interaction of framing members, sheathing material and anchors. The panel‘s length meets the requirements of its particular bracing method and contributes toward the total amount of bracing required along its braced wall line.',2,'2.1','BRACED WALL PANEL','A full-height clause',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000464","GHBC-REQ-000465"]','8ef2a3dd52b766737f99f1adb9da94ccbe72f022770a4a9daf6ec45187e80a4d'),
('chunk-202','GHBC-CHUNK-000202','GHBC-C-000202','BREAKOUT
For revolving doors, a process
whereby wings or door panels can be pushed open manually for means of escape travel.',2,'2.1','BREAKOUT','For revolving doors, a process',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000466"]','c23da9077d4e5fd26112fd8e3ae51098fee6529cf2557e682d1b5b2e34cd4a0f'),
('chunk-203','GHBC-CHUNK-000203','GHBC-C-000203','BRICK
Calcium silicate (sand lime brick). A pressed and subsequently autoclaved unit that consists
of sand and lime, with or without the inclusion of other materials. Clay. A solid or hollow masonry unit of clay, usually formed into a rectangular prism, then burned or fired in a kiln; brick is a ceramic product. Concrete. A concrete masonry unit made from Portland cement, water, and suitable aggregates, with or without the inclusion of other materials.',2,'2.1','BRICK',NULL,130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000467","GHBC-REQ-000468","GHBC-REQ-000469","GHBC-REQ-000470","GHBC-REQ-000471","GHBC-REQ-000472","GHBC-REQ-000473"]','95b4a5ac0255c1eb2635a7af0ccdd57cf3db89984aa924419f1269019bf3c0b4'),
('chunk-204','GHBC-CHUNK-000204','GHBC-C-000204','BUILDING
Any structure utilized or intended
for supporting or sheltering any occupancy. BUILDING',2,'2.1','BUILDING','Any structure utilized or intended',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000474","GHBC-REQ-000475"]','7c6abb9471c5170dce4650c03db76c4e92946bf9fd3ec6e8d3b12694e60ede6c'),
('chunk-205','GHBC-CHUNK-000205','GHBC-C-000205','ELEMENT
A fundamental component of building construction, listed in
resistance-rated construction and is constructed of materials based on the building type of construction. BUILDING-INTEGRATED PHOTOVOLTAIC (BIPV) PRODUCT. A building product that incorporates photovoltaic modules and functions as a component of the building envelope BUILDING-INTEGRATED PHOTOVOLTAIC',2,'2.1','ELEMENT',NULL,130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000476","GHBC-REQ-000477","GHBC-REQ-000478","GHBC-REQ-000479"]','ab8cd566f648c288c7fd63584add435b94bb3b901bdb74f1e42573c68ffa15af'),
('chunk-206','GHBC-CHUNK-000206','GHBC-C-000206','ROOF PANEL (BIPV ROOF PANEL)
A photovoltaic panel that functions as a component of the building envelope.',2,'2.1','ROOF PANEL (BIPV ROOF PANEL)',NULL,130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000480"]','51ff2b5b9a372d413fb9275b6e6f1d2ba18b1ff2f7c507ddc94df8524b4e435d'),
('chunk-207','GHBC-CHUNK-000207','GHBC-C-000207','BUILDING LINE
The line established by law,
beyond which a building shall not extend, except as specifically provided by law.',2,'2.1','BUILDING LINE','The line established by law,',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000481"]','6cf22475b46cf36cce1fdaeaf61d75e1ab9c7721396971aa8c9c7ec954abc6fd'),
('chunk-208','GHBC-CHUNK-000208','GHBC-C-000208','HEAD OF WORKS
The officer or other
designated authority charged with the administration and enforcement of this Code, or a duly authorized representative.',2,'2.1','HEAD OF WORKS','The officer or other',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000482"]','8375825c5e6851266a848112199388eb2b6f06cf6303a08020d7c47c91210649'),
('chunk-209','GHBC-CHUNK-000209','GHBC-C-000209','BUILT-UP ROOF COVERING
Two or more
layers of felt cemented together and surfaced with a cap sheet, mineral aggregate, smooth coating or similar surfacing material. CABLE-RESTRAINED, AIR-SUPPORTED',2,'2.1','BUILT-UP ROOF COVERING','Two or more',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000483","GHBC-REQ-000484"]','c3ffe6ccea2282ffcc8cd6947eb3261975d13fa447a87a5759a1ed8016ea3da1'),
('chunk-210','GHBC-CHUNK-000210','GHBC-C-000210','STRUCTURE
A structure in which the uplift is
resisted by cables or webbings which are anchored to either foundations or dead men. Reinforcing cable or webbing is attached by various methods to the membrane or is an integral part of the membrane. This is not a cable-supported structure.',2,'2.1','STRUCTURE','A structure in which the uplift is',130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000485","GHBC-REQ-000486","GHBC-REQ-000487"]','4e0fea884684f05d87d1421de189d10750dd1591de22c16f5eac4e55f1fd509e');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "chunks" ("id", "chunk_id", "clause_id", "text", "part", "section", "clause", "title", "page", "tables_json", "requirement_ids_json", "source_hash") VALUES ('chunk-211','GHBC-CHUNK-000211','GHBC-C-000211','CANOPY
A permanent structure or architectural projection of rigid construction over which a covering is attached that provides weather protection, identity or decoration. A canopy is permitted to be structurally
independent or supported by attachment to a building on one or more sides.',2,'2.1','CANOPY',NULL,130,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000488","GHBC-REQ-000489","GHBC-REQ-000490"]','df644c1cb3b3a0ec6ff7eb31612b032c0ce86b27c9145d8efa2df16f707e3b26'),
('chunk-212','GHBC-CHUNK-000212','GHBC-C-000212','CAPACITOR ENERGY STORAGE SYSTEM
A stationary, rechargeable energy storage system consisting of capacitors, chargers, controls and associated electrical equipment designed to provide electrical power to a building or facility. The system is typically used to provide standby or emergency power, an uninterruptable power supply, load shedding, load sharing or similar capabilities. Preengineered capacitor energy storage system. A capacitor energy storage system consisting of capacitors, an energy management system, components and modules that are produced in a factory, designed to constitute the system when assembled and shipped to the job site for assembly. Prepackaged capacitor energy storage system. A capacitor energy storage system consisting of capacitors, an energy management system, components and modules that is factory assembled and then shipped as a complete unit for installation at the job site. CARBON DIOXIDE EXTINGUISHING',2,'2.1','CAPACITOR ENERGY STORAGE SYSTEM',NULL,131,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000491","GHBC-REQ-000492","GHBC-REQ-000493","GHBC-REQ-000494","GHBC-REQ-000495","GHBC-REQ-000496","GHBC-REQ-000497"]','937db02dcba5ee906bf18097287ea7a1bcd1f35e51a943aed6f144864868afb4'),
('chunk-213','GHBC-CHUNK-000213','GHBC-C-000213','SYSTEMS
A system supplying carbon dioxide
(CO2) from a pressurized vessel through fixed pipes and nozzles. The system includes a manual- or automatic-actuating mechanism.',2,'2.1','SYSTEMS','A system supplying carbon dioxide',131,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000498","GHBC-REQ-000499"]','38777f9fb61739ec1a979c7d2786014d3d17b1d3ffce7ea67bfdce7802b52d4e'),
('chunk-214','GHBC-CHUNK-000214','GHBC-C-000214','CARBON MONOXIDE ALARM
A single- or multiple-station alarm intended to detect carbon monoxide gas and alert occupants by a distinct audible signal. It incorporates a sensor, control components and an alarm notification appliance in a single unit.',2,'2.1','CARBON MONOXIDE ALARM',NULL,131,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000500","GHBC-REQ-000501"]','f9718e101d86e1d80905d6f6323ada8aae9879caeedd140e6f67b2dfa56d8f22'),
('chunk-215','GHBC-CHUNK-000215','GHBC-C-000215','CARBON MONOXIDE DETECTOR
A device
with an integral sensor to detect carbon monoxide gas and transmit an alarm signal to a connected alarm control unit.',2,'2.1','CARBON MONOXIDE DETECTOR','A device',131,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000502"]','f51bb75112cfb911a4a20040ee465f3107fa8a3c6af73b1ced7c62feecdbbdef'),
('chunk-216','GHBC-CHUNK-000216','GHBC-C-000216','CARE SUITE
