('chunk-219','GHBC-CHUNK-000219','GHBC-C-000219','CEILING RADIATION DAMPER
A listed
device installed in a ceiling membrane of a fireresistance-rated floor/ceiling or roof/ceiling assembly to limit automatically the radiative heat transfer through an air inlet/outlet opening. Ceiling radiation dampers include air terminal units, ceiling dampers and ceiling air diffusers. CELL (Group I-3 occupancy). A room within a housing unit in a detention or correctional facility used to confine inmates or prisoners. CELL (masonry). A void space having a gross cross-clauseal area greater than 11/2 square inches (967 mm2).',2,'2.1','CEILING RADIATION DAMPER','A listed',131,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000506","GHBC-REQ-000507","GHBC-REQ-000508","GHBC-REQ-000509","GHBC-REQ-000510","GHBC-REQ-000511"]','1378d7c5a4903476e3daed1070d83680f207d3ab6d11b0d684e16f3f6bd944fa'),
