('chunk-229','GHBC-CHUNK-000229','GHBC-C-000229','CLINIC, OUTPATIENT
Buildings or portions
thereof used to provide medical care on less than a 24-hour basis to persons who are not rendered incapable of self-preservation by the services provided.',2,'2.1','CLINIC, OUTPATIENT','Buildings or portions',132,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000536"]','fdbbb13300aa90270b3605cf04310321daaa25edaf2ae5f996fb7fe3adddd7f6'),
('chunk-230','GHBC-CHUNK-000230','GHBC-C-000230','CLOSED SYSTEM
The use of a solid or liquid
