from the top of the foundation to the underside of floor framing for the lowest occupied floor level.',2,'2.1','CRIPPLE WALL','A framed stud wall extending',134,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000614"]','cc1611f74c9b04b95c2b0ceb693b8c20340b6b5b15b1c2e49048eb3b24112bc2'),
('chunk-255','GHBC-CHUNK-000255','GHBC-C-000255','CRITICAL CIRCUIT
