('chunk-364','GHBC-CHUNK-000364','GHBC-C-000364','FLAMMABLE GAS
A material that is a gas at 68°F (20°C) or less at 14.7 pounds per square inch atmosphere (psia) (101 kPa) of pressure [a material that has a boiling point of 68°F (20°C) or less at 14.7 psia (101 kPa)], which also meets one of the following:
