A room used in conjunction with or serving a Group H-5 occupancy, where HPM is stored or used and which is classified as a Group H-2, H-3 or H-4 occupancy.',2,'2.1','HPM ROOM',NULL,145,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-000959"]','704ac88285ca5d4f1d6bbb28977d5d6eaeca03dd27fea303c7c68cbaf5b1dca5'),
