flammable or combustible liquids are used, dispensed or mixed in open containers.',2,'2.1','ROOM','A room in which Class I, II and IIIA',146,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001000"]','38ff47e797f51428193bdd68318ebd36762cb764e9fe029f81b17eea4945dee4'),
