Forces and deformations
produced in structural members by the applied loads.',2,'2.1','LOAD EFFECTS','Forces and deformations',147,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001015"]','919996ec43d032562c6913cef8e4a458cc36af03a2fea2d99b1349aa1f54a0c9'),
('chunk-462','GHBC-CHUNK-000462','GHBC-C-000462','LOAD FACTOR
