('chunk-607','GHBC-CHUNK-000607','GHBC-C-000607','SKYLIGHTS AND SLOPED GLAZING
Glass
or other transparent or translucent glazing material installed at a slope of 15 degrees (0.26 rad) or more from vertical. Unit skylights, tubular daylighting devices, glazing materials, solariums, sunrooms, roofs and sloped walls are included in this definition.',2,'2.1','SKYLIGHTS AND SLOPED GLAZING','Glass',155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001270","GHBC-REQ-001271"]','7bf8b195c4d6fcce11500c72acc9eaa3c619827a3f81387d4a8d549cf1d3c6dc'),
('chunk-608','GHBC-CHUNK-000608','GHBC-C-000608','SLEEPING UNIT
A single unit that provides
rooms or spaces for one or more persons, includes permanent provisions for sleeping and can include provisions for living, eating and either sanitation or kitchen facilities but not both. Such rooms and spaces that are also part of a dwelling unit are not sleeping units.',2,'2.1','SLEEPING UNIT','A single unit that provides',155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001272","GHBC-REQ-001273"]','0498851366f92915f2e63a4dae673931cf36a634cbd104fefebbd55b142160fb'),
('chunk-609','GHBC-CHUNK-000609','GHBC-C-000609','SMOKE ALARM
