alarm responsive to smoke. See ―Multiplestation smoke alarm‖ and ―Single-station smoke alarm.‖',2,'2.1','SMOKE ALARM','A single- or multiple-station',155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001274","GHBC-REQ-001275"]','6e5d99e365255704560d7283a59b10fedbf5c61f56ed7cf4d75bb4b0ae2312ee'),
('chunk-610','GHBC-CHUNK-000610','GHBC-C-000610','SMOKE BARRIER
