('chunk-614','GHBC-CHUNK-000614','GHBC-C-000614','SMOKE PARTITION
A wall assembly that extends from the top of the foundation or floor below to the underside of the floor or roof sheathing, deck or slab above or to the underside of the ceiling above where the ceiling membrane is constructed to limit the transfer of smoke.',2,'2.1','SMOKE PARTITION',NULL,155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001281"]','5ea474973a131e7163b676da4595bd14866ac695c55c367206ba60624ccc5000'),
