Seating served by means of escape
that is not subject to smoke accumulation within or under a structure for a specified design time by means of passive design or by mechanical ventilation.
SOFT CONTAINED PLAY EQUIPMENT',2,'2.1','SEATING','Seating served by means of escape',155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001286","GHBC-REQ-001287"]','51cce39f91f23fdf146bac5f6ccbd91f3335ae7d2127b20c6aa0e7cd11d281a5'),
('chunk-618','GHBC-CHUNK-000618','GHBC-C-000618','STRUCTURE
A children‘s play structure
containing one or more components where the user enters a play environment that utilizes pliable materials.',2,'2.1','STRUCTURE','A children‘s play structure',155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001288"]','810356e66dd17e906092d6a215151e44bc682140d113ceb4ad11dcc823b69754'),
('chunk-619','GHBC-CHUNK-000619','GHBC-C-000619','SOLID
A material that has a melting point,
decomposes or sublimes at a temperature greater than 20°C (68°F).',2,'2.1','SOLID','A material that has a melting point,',155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001289"]','5ab3522a0fd3a8877d5caf6f9d2e6746c9547d43fb474ee26ac658955c1044d3'),
('chunk-620','GHBC-CHUNK-000620','GHBC-C-000620','SPECIAL AMUSEMENT BUILDING
A special
amusement building is any temporary or permanent building or portion thereof that is occupied for amusement, entertainment or educational purposes and that contains a device or system that conveys passengers or provides a walkway along, around or over a course in any direction so arranged that the means of escape path is not readily apparent due to visual or audio distractions or is intentionally confounded or is not readily available because of the nature of the attraction or mode of conveyance through the building or structure.
SPECIAL',2,'2.1','SPECIAL AMUSEMENT BUILDING','A special',155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001290","GHBC-REQ-001291"]','a927f6ff737f586f5d8eec205e128cf1487244ad488414e187c055da49fc0681');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "chunks" ("id", "chunk_id", "clause_id", "text", "part", "section", "clause", "title", "page", "tables_json", "requirement_ids_json", "source_hash") VALUES ('chunk-621','GHBC-CHUNK-000621','GHBC-C-000621','INSPECTION
Inspection of construction requiring the expertise of an approved special inspector in order to ensure compliance with this Code and the approved construction documents.
Continuous special inspection. Special inspection by the special inspector who is present continuously when and where the work to be inspected is being performed.
Periodic special inspection. Special inspection by the special inspector who is intermittently present where the work to be inspected has been or is being performed.',2,'2.1','INSPECTION',NULL,155,'["Table 601, which may or may not be of fire-"]','["GHBC-REQ-001292","GHBC-REQ-001293","GHBC-REQ-001294","GHBC-REQ-001295","GHBC-REQ-001296"]','bcd8a64a726ddbeefb4512cb396792425681ddbe63da0d4906ef75683b4acb1c'),
('chunk-622','GHBC-CHUNK-000622','GHBC-C-000622','SPECIAL INSPECTOR
