(Plus 0.3m for every (plus 0.3m for every
Additional 33000 V and additional 33000 V
Part thereof) and part thereof)',5,'5.5','5.5.5','Distance from Electric Lines',250,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003680","GHBC-REQ-003681","GHBC-REQ-003682","GHBC-REQ-003683","GHBC-REQ-003684","GHBC-REQ-003685","GHBC-REQ-003686","GHBC-REQ-003687","GHBC-REQ-003688","GHBC-REQ-003689","GHBC-REQ-003690","GHBC-REQ-003691","GHBC-REQ-003692"]','dad04e0e0ad3d1854c1a89b90dc4348c4374bbe4ea35a21215f961d7a9a94689'),
('chunk-1378','GHBC-CHUNK-001378','GHBC-C-001378','5.5.6
Distance of site from the normal edge of water course/area may be specified by the Authority, keeping in view the normal maximum flood/tide level.',5,'5.5','5.5.6',NULL,250,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003693"]','e4be492686568aeb6a109d2ca1d4330685825eff02ebfd205ad2e7c3dee8d61e'),
('chunk-1379','GHBC-CHUNK-001379','GHBC-C-001379','5.5.7
Size of Plots',5,'5.5','5.5.7','Size of Plots',250,'[]','[]','7f03fd9142936584b553abfbf792e77b74b768a47060d0174221692d563e76dc'),
('chunk-1380','GHBC-CHUNK-001380','GHBC-C-001380','5.5.7.1
Residential
Each plot shall have a minimum size/frontage corresponding to the type of development as given below:
Note – For low income housing see Appendix D.',5,'5.5','5.5.7.1','Residential',250,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003694","GHBC-REQ-003695"]','1e38800bc4c2c89903f042f62bb4961d321d40573da8a03dafe8733cab30ca3c');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "chunks" ("id", "chunk_id", "clause_id", "text", "part", "section", "clause", "title", "page", "tables_json", "requirement_ids_json", "source_hash") VALUES ('chunk-1381','GHBC-CHUNK-001381','GHBC-C-001381','5.5.7.1.1
The minimum size of the site for group housing development shall be as given in the Master Plan and local development control rules.',5,'5.5','5.5.7.1.1',NULL,251,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003696"]','5d5e2fc44718176b0c1282fe19ae1973b96aa633ace1c517c805c92c6bbc0f23'),
('chunk-1382','GHBC-CHUNK-001382','GHBC-C-001382','5.5.7.2
Industrial
The size of the plot shall not be less than 300 m2 and its width shall not be less than 15 m.',5,'5.5','5.5.7.2','Industrial',251,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003697"]','8b525a5687b19ea795b695b6929cec615b0df82b8681ff8423ae24413cb032ed'),
('chunk-1383','GHBC-CHUNK-001383','GHBC-C-001383','5.5.7.3
Other Land uses
The minimum size of plots for buildings for other uses like business, educational, mercantile, assembly (cinema theatre), petrol filling station, etc. shall be as decided by the Authority subject to 5.5.7.3.1.',5,'5.5','5.5.7.3','Other Land uses',251,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003698"]','5ad1999b2c7e9f075bf2b23c85e8d2e476db23b77a2a0d417dd1a84fea7df61b'),
('chunk-1384','GHBC-CHUNK-001384','GHBC-C-001384','5.5.7.3.1
Assembly Halls/Cinema Theatres
The minimum size of plot for assembly buildings/cinema theatres used for public entertainment and religious/social centres, with fixed seats shall be on the basis of seating capacity of the building at the rate of 1 m2 per seat.',5,'5.5','5.5.7.3.1','Assembly Halls/Cinema Theatres',251,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003699"]','38cd550add3822bf1be52f3c79c8134f198c164ff6ce337fa4f1d64360defbb2'),
('chunk-1385','GHBC-CHUNK-001385','GHBC-C-001385','5.5.7.3.2
Fuel/Gas filling Station
The size of the plot shall not be less than:
a) 31 x 17m in the case of petrol filling station with kiosk without service bay, and 37 x 31 m in the case of petrol filling station with service bay.',5,'5.5','5.5.7.3.2','Fuel/Gas filling Station',251,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-003700","GHBC-REQ-003701"]','7862d87a8d75326a9745feaea9400f833a77e3d284bc1ca4f3531ebd9aa2e920'),
('chunk-1386','GHBC-CHUNK-001386','GHBC-C-001386','5.6.1
General
Every room intended for human habitation shall abut on an interior or exterior open space or an open verandah, open to such interior or exterior open space.',5,'5.6','5.6.1','General',251,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003702"]','767b28a9dd72b9bdc6b40d929d51fb8d05ab9f27698fff33ff63cfde530bd07e'),
('chunk-1387','GHBC-CHUNK-001387','GHBC-C-001387','5.6.1.1
The open spaces inside and around a building have essentially to cater for the lighting and ventilation requirements of the rooms abutting such open spaces, and in the case of
buildings abutting on streets in the front, rear or sides, the open spaces provided shall be sufficient for the future widening of such streets.',5,'5.6','5.6.1.1',NULL,251,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003703","GHBC-REQ-003704"]','7dfa87d93b46dcd00f54ac224b9e43fa1e5dbeef2240b17f6d8f6b20d7281fed'),
('chunk-1388','GHBC-CHUNK-001388','GHBC-C-001388','5.6.1.2
Open spaces separate for each
building of wing – The open spaces shall be separate or distinct for each building and where a building has two or more wings, each wing shall have separate or distinct open spaces for the purposes of lighting and ventilation of the wings. However, separation between accessory and main buildings more than 7m in height shall not be less than 1.5m; for buildings up to 7m in height, no such separation shall be required.',5,'5.6','5.6.1.2','Open spaces separate for each',251,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003705","GHBC-REQ-003706"]','b6ceb6e187d9a9599e18d60406a0134bef75269afa132fea8e641ff433c6cd37'),
('chunk-1389','GHBC-CHUNK-001389','GHBC-C-001389','5.6.2
Residential Buildings',5,'5.6','5.6.2','Residential Buildings',251,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','[]','8e9a36a0f1ee0316010ca6b2a7342aac922a549ac2112c7c7e89aa9e94eeaf89'),
('chunk-1390','GHBC-CHUNK-001390','GHBC-C-001390','5.6.2.1
Exterior open Spaces',5,'5.6','5.6.2.1','Exterior open Spaces',251,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','[]','eb2082751d5c5b1ce66be2ba1ed444912ad29dfe43c5340b53bc3139aa46fec6');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "chunks" ("id", "chunk_id", "clause_id", "text", "part", "section", "clause", "title", "page", "tables_json", "requirement_ids_json", "source_hash") VALUES ('chunk-1391','GHBC-CHUNK-001391','GHBC-C-001391','5.6.2.1.1
Front Open Space
a) Every building fronting a street shall have a front space, forming an integral part of the site as below: Width of Front open street space, Fronting the Minimum plot (M) (m) 1.5* Up to 7.5* 3.0 7.5 to 18 4.5 18 to 30 6.0 Above 30 * For buildings up to a maximum height 7m. Note – In case a building abuts two or more streets, the value of open spaces is to be based on the average width of streets,
subject to a minimum of 1.8m for cases (ii), (iii) and (iv) of Table 4.1, above. b) For streets less than 7.5m in width, the distance of the building (building line) shall be at least 5m from the centre line of the street See 5.3.3.5. Note – This limiting distance has to be determined by the Authority for individual road/street widths taking into account the traffic flow.',5,'5.6','5.6.2.1.1','Front Open Space',251,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003707","GHBC-REQ-003708","GHBC-REQ-003709","GHBC-REQ-003710"]','46e2a95073f5c29219165ddbe275c26bd1328bad1ea670ea3e9691d933370bb4'),
('chunk-1392','GHBC-CHUNK-001392','GHBC-C-001392','5.6.2.1.2
Rear Open Space
a)  Every residential building shall have a rear open space, forming an integral part of the site, of an average width of 3m and at no place measuring less than 1.8m, except that in the case of a back-to-back-site, the width of the rear open space shall be 3m throughout.  Subject to the condition of free ventilation, the open space left up to half the width of the plot shall also be taken into account for calculating the average width of the rear open space.  For plots of depth less than 9m, for buildings up to 7, in height, the rear open space may be reduced to 1.5m. b) Rear Open Space to Extend Throughout the Rear Wall – The rear open space shall be co-extensive with the entire face of the rear wall.  If a building abuts on two or more streets, such rear open space shall be provided throughout the face of the rear wall.  Such rear wall shall be the wall on the opposite side of the face of the building abutting on the wider street unless the Authority directs otherwise.',5,'5.6','5.6.2.1.2','Rear Open Space',252,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003711","GHBC-REQ-003712","GHBC-REQ-003713","GHBC-REQ-003714","GHBC-REQ-003715"]','91a755c5c2369ff2b0689d4b553e4de945d57069055b03eecdf71213158e9f99'),
('chunk-1393','GHBC-CHUNK-001393','GHBC-C-001393','5.6.2.1.3
Side Open Space
a)  Every semi-detached and detached building shall have a permanently open air space, forming an integral part of the site as below: (i)  For detached buildings there shall be a minimum side open space of 3m on both the sides. NOTE: For detached residential buildings up to 7m in height on plots with a frontage less than 12m, one of the side open spaces may be reduced to 1.5m.
(ii) For semi-detached buildings, there shall be a minimum side open space f 3m on one side. NOTE:  For semi-detached buildings up to 7m in height on plots with a frontage less than 9m, the side open space may be reduced to 1.5m.
(iii) For row-type buildings, no side open is required. (b)  In the case of semi-detached buildings, the open spaces provided on one side shall be as in Clause 5.6.2.1.3 and all habitable rooms shall abut either on this side open space or front and rear open spaces or an interior open space Clause 5.6.2.5.',5,'5.6','5.6.2.1.3','Side Open Space',252,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003716","GHBC-REQ-003717","GHBC-REQ-003718","GHBC-REQ-003719","GHBC-REQ-003720","GHBC-REQ-003721"]','e9e91c3a3debd72c501761a054b9040308503ee7caa9862564c69330b2160c20'),
('chunk-1394','GHBC-CHUNK-001394','GHBC-C-001394','5.6.2.2
The provisions of Clause 5.6.2.1.2 and 5.6.2.1.3 are not applicable to parking lock-up garages up to 3m in height located at a distance of 7.5m from any street line or front boundary of the plot.',5,'5.6','5.6.2.2',NULL,252,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003722"]','405971f26bb252fa5e757f006f12cf1fb6e9bbd94f0fd8aea996afc132d54971'),
('chunk-1395','GHBC-CHUNK-001395','GHBC-C-001395','5.6.2.3
The open spaces mentioned in Clause
5.6.2.1.1 to 5.6.2.1.3 shall be for residential buildings up to a height of 10m.',5,'5.6','5.6.2.3','The open spaces mentioned in Clause',252,'["TABLE 5.2 - Side and Rear Open Spaces for"]','["GHBC-REQ-003723"]','7dd46a0ed8b4e59fa0db63aebd78cde5f7984890d9c842b2954eff7b87764dda'),
('chunk-1396','GHBC-CHUNK-001396','GHBC-C-001396','5.6.2.3.1
For buildings of height above 10m,
the open spaces (side and rear) shall be as given in Table 5.2.  The front open spaces for increasing heights of buildings shall be governed by 6.5.4.1(a).
