= Tabular allowable area factor (NS, S13R, S13D or SM value, as t applicable) in accordance with Table 6.92. NS = Tabular allowable area factor in accordance with Table 6.92 for a nonsprinklered building (regardless of whether the building is sprinklered). I
= Area factor increase due to frontage (percent) as calculated in f accordance with Clause 6.93.
6.9.2.4.1 Group H-2 or H-3 mixed occupancies. For a building containing Group H-2 or H-3 occupancies, the allowable area shall be determined in accordance with Clause 6.11.4.2, with the sprinkler system increase applicable only to the portions of the building not classified as Group H-2 or H-3.
Exception:  For buildings designed as separated occupancies under Clause 6.11.4 and equipped throughout with an automatic sprinkler system installed in accordance with Clause 10.33.1.2, the total building area shall be such that the aggregate sum of the ratios of the actual area of each storey divided by the allowable area of such stories determined in accordance with Equation 6-3 based on the applicable provisions of Clause 6.11.1, shall not exceed four.',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,298,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004648","GHBC-REQ-004649","GHBC-REQ-004650","GHBC-REQ-004651","GHBC-REQ-004652","GHBC-REQ-004653","GHBC-REQ-004654","GHBC-REQ-004655","GHBC-REQ-004656","GHBC-REQ-004657","GHBC-REQ-004658","GHBC-REQ-004659","GHBC-REQ-004660","GHBC-REQ-004661","GHBC-REQ-004662","GHBC-REQ-004663","GHBC-REQ-004664","GHBC-REQ-004665","GHBC-REQ-004666","GHBC-REQ-004667","GHBC-REQ-004668","GHBC-REQ-004669","GHBC-REQ-004670","GHBC-REQ-004671","GHBC-REQ-004672","GHBC-REQ-004673","GHBC-REQ-004674","GHBC-REQ-004675","GHBC-REQ-004676","GHBC-REQ-004677","GHBC-REQ-004678","GHBC-REQ-004679","GHBC-REQ-004680","GHBC-REQ-004681","GHBC-REQ-004682","GHBC-REQ-004683","GHBC-REQ-004684","GHBC-REQ-004685","GHBC-REQ-004686","GHBC-REQ-004687","GHBC-REQ-004688","GHBC-REQ-004689","GHBC-REQ-004690","GHBC-REQ-004691","GHBC-REQ-004692","GHBC-REQ-004693","GHBC-REQ-004694","GHBC-REQ-004695","GHBC-REQ-004696","GHBC-REQ-004697","GHBC-REQ-004698","GHBC-REQ-004699","GHBC-REQ-004700"]','bc42940d9e835b9626708d87e9b031a71797e604b84ee82e49ce477b9f557346'),
('chunk-1612','GHBC-CHUNK-001612','GHBC-C-001612','6.9.3
Frontage increase
Every building shall adjoin or have access to a public way to receive an area factor increase based on frontage. Area factor increase shall be determined in accordance with Clauses 6.93.1 through 6.93.3.',6,NULL,'6.9.3','Frontage increase',300,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004701","GHBC-REQ-004702"]','48868920ec20de7afe986fddc4d9330ba4a5324b843bdc0845a175e97d202dea'),
('chunk-1613','GHBC-CHUNK-001613','GHBC-C-001613','6.9.3.1
Minimum percentage of perimeter
To qualify for an area factor increase based on frontage, a building shall have not less than 25 percent of its perimeter on a public way or open space. Such open space shall be either on the same plot or dedicated for public use and shall be accessed from a street or approved fire lane.',6,NULL,'6.9.3.1','Minimum percentage of perimeter',300,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004703","GHBC-REQ-004704"]','626de6f6d45da378a10a4e2680463bc936cd4af464487ccc599a779ba773f2f0'),
('chunk-1614','GHBC-CHUNK-001614','GHBC-C-001614','6.9.3.2
Minimum frontage distance
To qualify for an area factor increase based on frontage, the public way or open space adjacent to the building perimeter shall have a minimum distance (W) of 20 feet (6096 mm) measured at right angles from the building face to any of the following:
1. The closest interior plot line.
2. The entire width of a street, alley or public way.
3. The exterior face of an adjacent building on the same property.
Where the value of W is greater than 9144 mm (30 feet), a value of 9144 mm (30 feet) shall be used in calculating the building area increase based on frontage, regardless of the actual width of the public way or open space. Where the value of W varies along the perimeter of the building, the calculation performed in accordance 609with Equation 6-5 shall be based on the weighted average calculated in accordance with Equation 6-4.
(Equation 6-4) Where:
W
(Width: weighted average) = Calculated width of p L
= Length of a portion of the exterior perimeter wall. n w
= Width (≥20 feet) of a public way or open space as n exterior perimeter wall. F = Building perimeter that fronts on a public way or o mm (20 feet) or more.
Exception: Where a building meets the requirements of Clause 6.10, as applicable, except for compliance with the minimum 18 288 mm (60-foot) public way or yard requirement, and the value of W is greater than 9144 mm (30 feet), the value of W shall not exceed 18 288 mm (60 feet).',6,NULL,'6.9.3.2','Minimum frontage distance',300,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004705","GHBC-REQ-004706","GHBC-REQ-004707","GHBC-REQ-004708","GHBC-REQ-004709","GHBC-REQ-004710","GHBC-REQ-004711","GHBC-REQ-004712","GHBC-REQ-004713","GHBC-REQ-004714","GHBC-REQ-004715","GHBC-REQ-004716","GHBC-REQ-004717","GHBC-REQ-004718","GHBC-REQ-004719","GHBC-REQ-004720"]','484825da09a5ea0b22e219b90c46eaf2c5e62553ee0ce6d0e6ee355f99b8e7b2'),
('chunk-1615','GHBC-CHUNK-001615','GHBC-C-001615','6.9.3.3
Amount of increase
The area factor increase based on frontage shall be determined in accordance with Equation 6-5:',6,NULL,'6.9.3.3','Amount of increase',301,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004721"]','c69a7fa86e05425cf9d1e3c5b9c0c6a1c056410b6c3e0004f0cc1e23f920b795'),
('chunk-1616','GHBC-CHUNK-001616','GHBC-C-001616','6.10.1
General
The area of buildings of the occupancies and configurations specified in Clauses 6.10.1 through 6.10.13 shall not be limited. Basements not more than one storey below grade plane shall be permitted.',6,'6.10','6.10.1','General',301,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004722","GHBC-REQ-004723"]','09d19dff229bfe64d87bdda96b1f3ee08763d73ee9b896625d4c89e08007880c'),
('chunk-1617','GHBC-CHUNK-001617','GHBC-C-001617','6.10.1.1
Accessory occupancies
Accessory occupancies shall be permitted in unlimited area buildings in accordance with the provisions of Clause 6.11.2, otherwise the requirements of Clause 6.10.3 through 6.10.13 shall be applied, where applicable.',6,'6.10','6.10.1.1','Accessory occupancies',301,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004724"]','1b09ed752c58681117b84493ce84c9de29d3113f3d451845dc9989a6cbcbed4f'),
('chunk-1618','GHBC-CHUNK-001618','GHBC-C-001618','6.10.2
Measurement of open spaces
Where Clause 6.10.3 through 6.10.13 requires buildings to be surrounded and adjoined by public ways and yards, those open spaces shall be determined as follows:
1. Yards shall be measured from the building perimeter in all directions to the closest interior plot lines or to the exterior face of an opposing building located on the same plot, as applicable.
2. Where the building fronts on a public way, the entire width of the public way shall be used.',6,'6.10','6.10.2','Measurement of open spaces',301,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004725","GHBC-REQ-004726","GHBC-REQ-004727","GHBC-REQ-004728","GHBC-REQ-004729"]','4259a3b949ddfaa99936f0d1db24dfd99afe53d0f7fdd9ab2eec81f2a89c264b'),
('chunk-1619','GHBC-CHUNK-001619','GHBC-C-001619','6.10.2.1
Reduced open space
The public ways or yards of 18 288 mm (60 feet) in width required in Clauses 6.10.3, 6.10.4, 6.10.5, 6.10.6 and 6.10.12 shall be permitted to be reduced to not less than 12 192 mm (40 feet) in width provided all of the following requirements are met: 1. The reduced width shall not be allowed',6,'6.10','6.10.2.1','Reduced open space',301,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004730","GHBC-REQ-004731"]','2d53311dea0412b31280473a43ecde4292c392824b7d925c6912aa24e5dc01c4'),
('chunk-1620','GHBC-CHUNK-001620','GHBC-C-001620','for more than 75 percent of the perimeter of',6,NULL,NULL,NULL,301,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-004732"]','0543f444f7cd446fe11af7bfae5ab755e154639bef74ec37db84af1ee9cdd85c');
