('chunk-1952','GHBC-CHUNK-001952','GHBC-C-001952','8.16.2.1.2
Other types of assemblies
Fire door assemblies with other types of doors, including swinging elevator doors, horizontal sliding fire doors, rolling steel fire doors, fire shutters, bottom- and side-hinged chute intake doors, and top-hinged chute discharge doors, shall be tested in accordance with the Ghana
