('chunk-1973','GHBC-CHUNK-001973','GHBC-C-001973','8.16.2.6.1
Door closing
Fire doors shall be latching and self- or automatic-closing in accordance with this clause.
Exceptions:
1. Fire doors located in common walls separating sleeping units in Group R-1 shall be permitted without automatic- or self-closing devices.
