('chunk-1984','GHBC-CHUNK-001984','GHBC-C-001984','8.16.2.9.3
Smoke and draft control door
labeling requirements. Smoke and draft control doors complying with this Code shall be labeled in accordance with Clause 8.16.2.9.1 and shall show the letter ―S‖ on the fire-rating label of the door. This marking shall indicate that the door and frame assembly are in compliance where listed or labeled gasketing is installed.
