('chunk-2005','GHBC-CHUNK-002005','GHBC-C-002005','8.17.1
General
The provisions of this clause shall govern the protection of duct penetrations and air transfer openings in assemblies required to be protected and duct penetrations in nonfireresistance-rated floor assemblies.',8,'8.17','8.17.1','General',361,'["TABLE 717.3.2.1","Table 717.3.2.1 and shall have the minimum"]','["GHBC-REQ-006091"]','114424e00ae50306122427ac2640e3b337a2e4689ec09efb698eacc0f34a6f83'),
('chunk-2006','GHBC-CHUNK-002006','GHBC-C-002006','8.17.1.1
Ducts and air transfer openings
Ducts transitioning horizontally between shafts shall not require a shaft enclosure provided that the duct penetration into each associated shaft is protected with dampers complying with this clause.',8,'8.17','8.17.1.1','Ducts and air transfer openings',361,'["TABLE 717.3.2.1","Table 717.3.2.1 and shall have the minimum"]','["GHBC-REQ-006092"]','07d69b107c1bf36f1eda07580314dc11664ede54d3f9ce189edc67e72a043d8f'),
('chunk-2007','GHBC-CHUNK-002007','GHBC-C-002007','8.17.1.2
Ducts that penetrate fire-resistance-
rated assemblies without dampers. Ducts that penetrate fire-resistance-rated walls and are not required by this clause to have fire dampers shall comply with the requirements of Clauses 8.14.3 through 8.14.4.3. Ducts that penetrate horizontal assemblies not required to be contained within a shaft and not required by this clause to have fire dampers shall comply with the requirements of Clauses 8.14.5 through 8.14.6.2.',8,'8.17','8.17.1.2','Ducts that penetrate fire-resistance-',361,'["TABLE 717.3.2.1","Table 717.3.2.1 and shall have the minimum"]','["GHBC-REQ-006093","GHBC-REQ-006094","GHBC-REQ-006095"]','2e60b6392f538ed2c2611f178249fb6f3ece5bc286d95e7826041e518c1d7055'),
('chunk-2008','GHBC-CHUNK-002008','GHBC-C-002008','8.17.1.2.1
