FIRE DAMPER RATING',8,'8.17','8.17.3.2.1','Fire damper ratings',362,'["TABLE 717.3.2.1","Table 717.3.2.1 and shall have the minimum"]','["GHBC-REQ-006115","GHBC-REQ-006116"]','2bf4efb4d3836ce9aad18d5c0fedbd18e80e29a5194918b3eb45082abc48fe35'),
('chunk-2014','GHBC-CHUNK-002014','GHBC-C-002014','8.17.3.2.2
Smoke damper ratings
Smoke damper leakage ratings shall be Class I or II. Elevated temperature ratings shall be not less than 250°F (121°C).',8,'8.17','8.17.3.2.2','Smoke damper ratings',363,'["TABLE 717.3.2.1","Table 717.3.2.1 and shall have the minimum"]','["GHBC-REQ-006117","GHBC-REQ-006118"]','b6e97ec783368c6a0b6c1878dcce2abe95cb20c2792082c2ca14787a814b6e3a'),
('chunk-2015','GHBC-CHUNK-002015','GHBC-C-002015','8.17.3.2.3
