('chunk-2074','GHBC-CHUNK-002074','GHBC-C-002074','8.21.1
General
The provisions of this clause contain prescriptive details of fire-resistance-rated building elements, components or assemblies. The materials of construction listed in Tables 8.21.1(1), 8.21.1(2) and 8.21.1(3) shall be assumed to have the fire-resistance ratings prescribed therein. Where materials that change the capacity for heat dissipation are incorporated into a fire-resistance-rated assembly, fire test results or other substantiating data shall be made available to the building official to show that the required fire-resistance-rating time period is not reduced.
