Nonsymmetrical assemblies
For a wall without finish on one side or having different types or thicknesses of finish on each side, the calculation procedures of this clause shall be performed twice, assuming either side to be the fire-exposed side of the wall. The fire resistance of the wall shall not exceed the lower of the two values determined.
