('chunk-2164','GHBC-CHUNK-002164','GHBC-C-002164','8.22.5.2.1.2
Beam and girder substitutions
Except as provided for in Clause 8.22.5.2.2, structural steel beams in approved fireresistance-rated assemblies shall be considered to be the minimum permissible size. Other beam or girder shapes shall be permitted to be substituted provided that the weight-toheated-perimeter ratio (W/D) of the substitute beam is equal to or greater than that of the beam specified in the approved assembly.',8,NULL,'8.22.5.2.1.2','Beam and girder substitutions',430,'["TABLE 8.22.2.1.2(2)","Table 8.22.2.1.2(2).","TABLE 8.22.2.1.4(1) MULTIPLYING FACTOR FOR FINISHES ON NON FIREEXPOSED SIDE OF","TABLE 8.22.2.1.4(2) TIME ASSIGNED TO FINISH MATERIALS ON FIRE-EXPOSED SIDE OF WALL","TABLE 8.22.2.2.1","TABLE 8.22.2.3(1)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(2)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3) MINIMUM COVER FOR MAIN REINFORCING BARS OF REINFORCED","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(3)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(4)","TABLE 8.22.2.3(5) MINIMUM COVER FOR PRESTRESSED CONCRETE BEAMS OF ALL WIDTHS","TABLE 8.22.2.4 MINIMUM DIMENSION OF","TABLE 8.22.3.2 MINIMUM EQUIVALENT THICKNESS (inches) OF BEARING OR NONBEARING","TABLE 8.22.3.4 MINIMUM COVER OF","TABLE 8.22.3.5 MINIMUM DIMENSION OF","TABLE 8.22.4.1(1)","TABLE 8.22.4.1(1)","TABLE 8.22.4.1(3)","TABLE 8.22.4.1(4)","TABLE 8.22.4.1(5)","TABLE 8.22.4.1(6) REINFORCED CLAY","Table 8.22.4.1(4) based on the actual thickness","Table 8.22.3.2 for concrete masonry units or","Table 8.22.4.1(1) or 8.22.4.1(2) for clay and tile","TABLE 8.22.5.1(1) W/D RATIOS FOR STEEL COLUMNS","TABLE 8.22.5.1(2) PROPERTIES OF CONCRETE","TABLE 8.22.5.1(4) WEIGHT-TO-HEATED-PERIMETER RATIOS (W/D) FOR TYPICAL WIDE","TABLE 8.22.5.1(4)—continued","TABLE 8.22.5.1(4)—continued","TABLE 8.22.5.1(5) FIRE RESISTANCE OF CONCRETE MASONRY PROTECTED STEEL","TABLE 8.22.5.1(5)—continued","TABLE 8.22.5.1(6)","TABLE 8.22.5.1(7) MINIMUM COVER (inch) FOR STEEL COLUMNS ENCASED IN","TABLE 8.22.5.1(9) MINIMUM COVER (inch) FOR STEEL COLUMNS IN NORMA