Building-integrated photovoltaic
products. Building-integrated photovoltaic products installed as the roof covering shall be tested, listed and labeled for fire classification in accordance with Clause 16.5.1.',16,'16.5','16.5.8','Building-integrated photovoltaic',624,'["TABLE 16.5.1a, b MINIMUM ROOF COVERING CLASSIFICATION","Table 16.5.1 based on the type of construction"]','["GHBC-REQ-012081","GHBC-REQ-012082"]','8fb904e21a3a96e3dcc677c39178e0e814fce34308b9b58c23e888b8e0302e8f'),
