systems. Rooftop rack-mounted photovoltaic panel systems shall be tested, listed and identified with a fire classification in accordance with IEC 61730. The fire classification shall comply with
of the building.',16,'16.5','16.5.9','Rooftop mounted photovoltaic panel',624,'["TABLE 16.5.1a, b MINIMUM ROOF COVERING CLASSIFICATION","Table 16.5.1 based on the type of construction"]','["GHBC-REQ-012083","GHBC-REQ-012084","GHBC-REQ-012085","GHBC-REQ-012086"]','f3b95571b262752322cc16819c7c09c8030169aed3f6752970cbd28601bbc070'),
