Roof gardens and landscaped roofs shall comply with Clause 16.5.1 and 16.7.16 and shall be installed in accordance with this Code.',16,'16.5','16.5.10','Roof gardens and landscaped roofs',624,'["TABLE 16.5.1a, b MINIMUM ROOF COVERING CLASSIFICATION","Table 16.5.1 based on the type of construction"]','["GHBC-REQ-012087"]','dcc2dcd13b8778fb9a2b23cc435d1147865eebfd83dcf7b2e9cd659c5d9c21aa'),
('chunk-3424','GHBC-CHUNK-003424','GHBC-C-003424','16.6.1
