The requirements set forth in this clause shall apply to the application of roof-covering materials specified herein. Roof coverings shall be applied in accordance with this part and the manufacturer‘s installation instructions. Installation of roof coverings shall comply with the applicable provisions of Clause 16.7.',16,'16.6','16.6.1','Scope',624,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-012088","GHBC-REQ-012089","GHBC-REQ-012090"]','bf5b5d0f8e2872565c495c86930037f894f538b7458127b733ca1bb5eed4d620'),
