('chunk-3434','GHBC-CHUNK-003434','GHBC-C-003434','16.7.2.5
Fasteners
Fasteners for asphalt shingles shall be galvanized, stainless steel, aluminum or copper roofing nails, minimum 12-gage [2.67 mm
(0.105 inch)] shank with a minimum 9.5 mm (3 / -inch-diameter) head, of a length to penetrate through the roofing materials and not8
less than 19.1 mm3 ( / inch) into the roof sheathing. Where the roof sheathing is less4
