('chunk-3458','GHBC-CHUNK-003458','GHBC-C-003458','16.7.4.2
Deck slope
Minimum slopes for metal roof panels shall comply with the following:
1. The minimum slope for lapped, nonsoldered seam metal roof panels without applied lap sealant shall be three units vertical in 12 units horizontal (25-percent slope).
2. The minimum slope for lapped, nonsoldered seam metal roof panels with applied lap sealant shall be one-half unit vertical in 12 units horizontal (4-percent slope). Lap sealants shall be applied in accordance with the approved manufacturer‘s installation instructions.
3. The minimum slope for standing-seam metal roof panel systems shall be one-quarter unit vertical in 12 units horizontal (2-percent slope).',16,'16.7','16.7.4.2','Deck slope',632,'["TABLE 16.7.1.1(1) UNDERLAYMENT TYPES","TABLE 16.7.1.1(2) UNDERLAYMENT APPLICATION","TABLE 16.7.1.1(3): UNDERLAYMENT ATTACHMENT","TABLE 16.7.2.8.2: VALLEY LINING","TABLE 16.7.3.7: CLAY AND CONCRETE TILE ATTACHMENTa, b, c","TABLE 16.7.4.3(1): METAL ROOF","TABLE 16.7.4.3(2): MINIMUM CORROSION","Table 16.7.4.3(1). The valley flashing shall","TABLE 16.7.7.6: SLATE SHINGLE HEADLAP","TABLE 16.7.8: WOOD SHINGLE AND SHAKE INSTALLATION","Table 16.7.8.5.","TABLE 16.7.8.5: WOOD SHINGLE","TABLE 16.7.8.7: WOOD SHINGLE WEATHER EXPOSURE AND ROOF SLOPE","TABLE 16.7.10.2: BUILT-UP ROOFING","TABLE 16.7.14.3: PROTECTIVE COATING"]','["GHBC-REQ-012223","GHBC-REQ-012224","GHBC-REQ-012225","GHBC-REQ-012226","GHBC-REQ-012227","GHBC-REQ-012228","GHBC-REQ-012229","GHBC-REQ-012230"]','4e98678d551983aaf8b4a27fb0cf9313228701435d76de18fedbd2f58dff0bf8'),
('chunk-3459','GHBC-CHUNK-003459','GHBC-C-003459','16.7.4.3
Material standards
Metal-sheet roof covering systems that incorporate supporting structural members shall be designed in accordance with Part 22. Metalsheet roof coverings installed over structural decking shall comply with Table 16.7.4.3(1). The materials used for metal-sheet roof coverings shall be naturally corrosion resistant or provided with corrosion resistance in accordance with the standards and minimum thicknesses shown in Table 16.7.4.3(2).
