('chunk-3519','GHBC-CHUNK-003519','GHBC-C-003519','16.8.1
General
The use of above-deck thermal insulation shall be permitted provided that such insulation is covered with an approved roof covering and passes the tests of the Ghana Fire Code when tested as an assembly.
Exceptions:
1. Foam plastic roof insulation shall conform to the material and installation requirements of Part 27.
2. Where a concrete roof deck is used and the above-deck thermal insulation is covered with an approved roof covering.',16,'16.8','16.8.1','General',640,'["TABLE 16.8.2: MATERIAL STANDARDS FOR"]','["GHBC-REQ-012350","GHBC-REQ-012351","GHBC-REQ-012352","GHBC-REQ-012353","GHBC-REQ-012354","GHBC-REQ-012355"]','80544e5e200ef2d15cfec3ae9031a25f1292bd59fd89b005b9529ddbcb61db97'),
