The hoops and cross ties shall be equivalent to deformed bars not less than No. 3 in size. Rectangular hoop ends shall terminate at a corner with seismic hooks.
Outside of the length of the pile requiring transverse confinement reinforcing, the spiral or hoop reinforcing with a volumetric ratio not less than one-half of that required for transverse confinement reinforcing shall be provided.
Exception: The minimum spiral reinforcement index required by Equation 18-5 shall not apply in cases where the design includes full consideration of load combinations specified in ASCE 7, Clause 2.3.6 and the applicable overstrength factor, Ω0. In such cases, minimum spiral reinforcement index shall be as specified in Clause 18.10.3.8.1.
Exception: The minimum spiral reinforcement required by Equation 18-6 shall not apply in cases where the design includes full consideration of load combinations specified in ASCE 7, Clause 2.3.6 and the applicable overstrength factor, Ω0. In such cases, minimum spiral reinforcement shall be as specified in Clause 18.10.3.8.1.',18,'18.10','18.10.3.8.3.1','Effective prestress',769,'["TABLE 18.10.3.2.6"]','["GHBC-REQ-014366","GHBC-REQ-014367","GHBC-REQ-014368","GHBC-REQ-014369","GHBC-REQ-014370","GHBC-REQ-014371","GHBC-REQ-014372","GHBC-REQ-014373","GHBC-REQ-014374","GHBC-REQ-014375","GHBC-REQ-014376","GHBC-REQ-014377","GHBC-REQ-014378","GHBC-REQ-014379","GHBC-REQ-014380","GHBC-REQ-014381","GHBC-REQ-014382","GHBC-REQ-014383","GHBC-REQ-014384","GHBC-REQ-014385","GHBC-REQ-014386","GHBC-REQ-014387","GHBC-REQ-014388","GHBC-REQ-014389","GHBC-REQ-014390","GHBC-REQ-014391","GHBC-REQ-014392","GHBC-REQ-014393","GHBC-REQ-014394","GHBC-REQ-014395","GHBC-REQ-014396","GHBC-REQ-014397","GHBC-REQ-014398","GHBC-REQ-014399","GHBC-REQ-014400","GHBC-REQ-014401","GHBC-REQ-014402","GHBC-REQ-014403","GHBC-REQ-014404","GHBC-REQ-014405","GHBC-REQ-014406","GHBC-REQ-014407","GHBC-REQ-014408","GHBC-REQ-014409","GHBC-REQ-014410","GHBC-REQ-014411","GHBC-REQ-014412","GHBC-REQ-014413","GHBC-REQ-014414","GHBC-REQ-014415","GHBC-REQ-014416","GHBC-REQ-014417","GHBC-REQ-014418"]','13ccbcece909eaca667c12a820ecafb858c71fd8b43e28cf8169e1c6773401ef'),
('chunk-3843','GHBC-CHUNK-003843','GHBC-C-003843','18.10.3.8.3.4
