('chunk-3844','GHBC-CHUNK-003844','GHBC-C-003844','18.10.3.9
Cast-in-place deep foundations
Cast-in-place deep foundation elements shall be designed and detailed in accordance with Clauses 18.10.3.9.1 through 18.10.3.9.6. (Equation 18-9)',18,'18.10','18.10.3.9','Cast-in-place deep foundations',770,'["TABLE 18.10.3.2.6"]','["GHBC-REQ-014426","GHBC-REQ-014427"]','191a836df967b8263cc63e7c69820199af2735cf96623abbbb4ee11d112c6865'),
('chunk-3845','GHBC-CHUNK-003845','GHBC-C-003845','18.10.3.9.1
