shall be deemed to meet the requirements of this clause.',24,'24.4','24.4.8.1','Structural floor sheathing',861,'["TABLE 24.4.6.1 MAXIMUM ALLOWABLE STRESS DESIGN WIND SPEED, Vasd PERMITTED FOR","TABLE 24.4.8(1) ALLOWABLE SPANS FOR TIMBER FLOOR AND ROOF SHEATHING","TABLE 24.4.8(2) SHEATHING TIMBER, MINIMUM GRADE REQUIREMENTS: BOARD GRADE","TABLE 24.4.8(3) ALLOWABLE SPANS AND LOADS FOR WOOD STRUCTURAL PANEL","TABLE 24.4.8(4) ALLOWABLE SPAN FOR","TABLE 24.4.8(5) ALLOWABLE LOAD (PSF) FOR WOOD STRUCTURAL PANEL ROOF SHEATHING","Table 24.4.8(1), 24.4.8(2), 24.4.8(3) or 24.4.8(4)","Table 24.4.8(1), 24.4.8(2), 24.4.8(3) or 24.4.8(5)","Table 24.4.9.3.2 shall be permitted.","TABLE 24.4.9.3.2 FASTENING SCHEDULE","TABLE 24.4.10.1"]','["GHBC-REQ-016379","GHBC-REQ-016380","GHBC-REQ-016381"]','c2700c98fe5a7e1479c355aa7c21e5d880645bfcfeb28efe7f18f8aecb4423d5'),
