Where wood furring is used to attach cladding over foam sheathing, furring minimum fastening requirements to support the cladding weight shall be as specified in Table 27.3.13.2. Where placed horizontally, wood furring shall be preservative-treated wood in accordance with',27,NULL,'27.3.13.2','Furred cladding attachment',979,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-017999","GHBC-REQ-018000"]','aa195e4ac5b78b9edf5265224b46a6e317964a79a7e264103ec100615e6f9ede'),
