a, b
indicated 8-inch and 12-inch fastener spacing in furring shall be achieved by use of two fasteners into studs at 16 inches and 24 inches on center, respectively.',27,NULL,NULL,NULL,979,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-018001","GHBC-REQ-018002","GHBC-REQ-018003","GHBC-REQ-018004","GHBC-REQ-018005","GHBC-REQ-018006","GHBC-REQ-018007","GHBC-REQ-018008","GHBC-REQ-018009","GHBC-REQ-018010","GHBC-REQ-018011","GHBC-REQ-018012"]','8bb7b537b58d9b8cc8a68af221fc71df0cbb85c9f86293fbbef0d1cf0b3dfd60'),
('chunk-4665','GHBC-CHUNK-004665','GHBC-C-004665','27.4
INTERIOR FINISH AND TRIM',27,NULL,'27.4','INTERIOR FINISH AND TRIM',980,'[]','[]','714ef1869b16d2fdc742791b0f00f639f8dd163b6d8e88c471161f66442f686e'),
('chunk-4666','GHBC-CHUNK-004666','GHBC-C-004666','27.4.1
General
Plastic materials installed as interior finish or trim shall comply with Part 9. Foam plastics shall only be installed as interior finish where approved in accordance with the special provisions of Clause 27.3.9. Foam plastics that are used as interior finish shall meet the flame spread and smoke-developed index requirements for interior finish in accordance with Part 9. Foam plastics installed as interior trim shall comply with Clause 27.4.2.',27,NULL,'27.4.1','General',980,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-018013","GHBC-REQ-018014","GHBC-REQ-018015","GHBC-REQ-018016"]','35466814e20ddde4945209b6a46af6334c4b25189d04d045a4f7facd702fbccf'),
('chunk-4667','GHBC-CHUNK-004667','GHBC-C-004667','27.4.1.1
Plenums
Foam plastics installed in plenums as interior wall or ceiling finish shall comply with Clause 27.3.7. Foam plastics installed in plenums as interior trim shall comply with Clauses 27.4.2 and 27.3.7.',27,NULL,'27.4.1.1','Plenums',980,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-018017","GHBC-REQ-018018"]','28e358fb2e300bcb712db4f54dfba25c0a85b3bc827e351c46b656cdf95568c9'),
('chunk-4668','GHBC-CHUNK-004668','GHBC-C-004668','27.4.2
Interior trim
Foam plastic used as interior trim shall comply with Clauses 27.4.2.1 through 27.4.2.4.',27,NULL,'27.4.2','Interior trim',980,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-018019"]','0bff198e0b32862e09ef41dd0dd1f2bb46bb074630a7ac615cff371e6d03a804'),
('chunk-4669','GHBC-CHUNK-004669','GHBC-C-004669','27.4.2.1
Density
The minimum density of the interior trim shall be 320 kg/m3 (20 pcf).',27,NULL,'27.4.2.1','Density',980,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-018020"]','570afb6d48926baddbd786a074bd376b4b3a01f92800a5ed6c13830d9116e459'),
('chunk-4670','GHBC-CHUNK-004670','GHBC-C-004670','27.4.2.2
Thickness
The maximum thickness of the interior trim shall be 12.7 mm (1 / inch) and the maximum width shall be 204 mm (8 inches).2',27,NULL,'27.4.2.2','Thickness',980,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-018021"]','8b737a26159e4ff8de9b5876e8d554bcbe5ee8dcf9e3404cfe5864ba3dca21d7');
