('chunk-4942','GHBC-CHUNK-004942','GHBC-C-004942','28.9.1
Ceiling roses and similar attachments',28,'28.9','28.9.1','Ceiling roses and similar attachments',1051,'[]','[]','16b5532fe6afdd803355f01e9d82ddd2d9069892386719e088bb427eff08ee59'),
('chunk-4943','GHBC-CHUNK-004943','GHBC-C-004943','28.9.1.1
A ceiling rose or any other similar
