('chunk-5096','GHBC-CHUNK-005096','GHBC-C-005096','29.2.2.4.3
All shafts shall be provided with fire barrier at floor crossings.',29,NULL,'29.2.2.4.3',NULL,1092,'["TABLE 29.8.6.5.2"]','["GHBC-REQ-019863"]','9b73944ae9875bd77dd77161bcd5fe7bc9bc1c95201400707ebdbf1cb7cfccf5'),
