('chunk-5099','GHBC-CHUNK-005099','GHBC-C-005099','29.2.2.5.1
Duct supports, preferably in the form of angles of mild steel supported using stud anchors shall be provided on the ceiling slab from the drilled hole. Alternately, duct supports may be fixed with internally threaded anchor fasteners and threaded rods without damaging the slabs or structural members.',29,NULL,'29.2.2.5.1',NULL,1092,'["TABLE 29.8.6.5.2"]','["GHBC-REQ-019866","GHBC-REQ-019867"]','49087ffb0f9db00760d62c0bf3d7a557ea3f20146dd0aeb726d7cf6564b3e7cd'),
