The scheme of colour Code for painting of pipe work services for air conditioning installation shall be as indicated in',29,NULL,'29.2.10.5.1.1',NULL,1128,'["TABLE 29.8.6.5.2"]','["GHBC-REQ-020733"]','8e02dff7304b5ed79de976bf0b8fc76b1bd91ac99962e4c2a3cb50eaccca1c21'),
('chunk-5292','GHBC-CHUNK-005292','GHBC-C-005292','29.2.10.5.1.2
In addition to the colour bands
specified above, all pipe work shall be legibly marked with black or white letters to indicate the type of service and the direction of flow, identified as follows:',29,NULL,'29.2.10.5.1.2','In addition to the colour bands',1128,'["TABLE 29.8.6.5.2"]','["GHBC-REQ-020734"]','7159e28cd6db6677b4e91c03e27c3904446187922574f972e20745a60e67771a'),
('chunk-5293','GHBC-CHUNK-005293','GHBC-C-005293','29.2.10.5.2
Duct work services',29,NULL,'29.2.10.5.2','Duct work services',1128,'["TABLE 29.8.6.5.2"]','[]','ec8c77b2bd2b4a17f79e3dbb4c3802e9d0c205463e589f0535dd3fe592b1caf5'),
('chunk-5294','GHBC-CHUNK-005294','GHBC-C-005294','29.2.10.5.2.1
For duct work services and their
