('chunk-5370','GHBC-CHUNK-005370','GHBC-C-005370','29.3.3.3.1.1.2
System outdoor airflow
The outdoor air required to be supplied by each ventilation system shall be determined in accordance with Clauses 29.3.3.3.1.1.2.1 through 29.3.3.3.1.1.2.3.4 as a function of system type and zone outdoor airflow rates.',29,NULL,'29.3.3.3.1.1.2','System outdoor airflow',1147,'["TABLE 29.8.6.5.2"]','["GHBC-REQ-021019"]','0ace55e2b919a98ebcb6af8e6a94981b385f1633903e7b35fa9f7141aaa44ce8');
