APPENDIX ‗D‘ (Clause 9.4.3.3)
OUTDOOR NOISE REGULATIONS IN GHANA
D-1 Government notifications are issued form time-to-time on the allowable ambient noise levels in general and specifically in different zones of various metropolitan cities of India. D-2 Noise regulations and notifications are also issued from time-to-time specifying the maximum permissible sound levels from equipments commonly used in and around the residential areas and around sensitive buildings, specifically with regard to noise
