('chunk-6363','GHBC-CHUNK-006363','GHBC-C-006363','31.1.4.9.1
General
The dimensions of the lift well have been chosen to accommodate the doors inside the well which is the normal practice.  In special cases, the door may be accommodated in a recess in the front wall, for which prior consultation shall be made with the lift manufacturer.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.9.1','General',1300,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024640","GHBC-REQ-024641"]','1d61fe13f42a15c883f6571a70325c63e537e3957c74eba3b61a783f39c3332a'),
('chunk-6364','GHBC-CHUNK-006364','GHBC-C-006364','31.1.4.9.2
