having more than one car entrance, lift manufacturers should be consulted.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.9.2.5','For outline dimensions of lifts',1301,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024649"]','9c80edb6b09354379e7b88881c7bd1cf8c7102893441f57eb39f6ac1f8be926a'),
