('chunk-6373','GHBC-CHUNK-006373','GHBC-C-006373','31.1.4.9.3.3
Pit
The pit depth of the lifts will normally accommodate compensating chains.
If compensating ropes are required, pit depth shall
be increased for all loads and speeds and the lift manufacturer should be consulted.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.9.3.3','Pit',1303,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024683","GHBC-REQ-024684","GHBC-REQ-024685"]','4534be33c95f34889e4514e2559bb13f1f97a620398c5822f4a2001062b04702'),
