('chunk-6377','GHBC-CHUNK-006377','GHBC-C-006377','31.1.4.10.1.1
No equipment except that forming
a part of the lift or necessary for its operation and maintenance shall be installed in the lift well.  For this purpose, the main supply lines shall be deemed to be a part of the lift and the underground cable, if laid along the lift well shaft, shall be properly clamped to the wall.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.1','No equipment except that forming',1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024687","GHBC-REQ-024688"]','c61116c49f918cbde361c51cca15fbb6f9ac716dd99bf894295ec6d6f27fec3b'),
('chunk-6378','GHBC-CHUNK-006378','GHBC-C-006378','31.1.4.10.1.2
Sufficient space shall be provided between the guides for the cars and the side walls of the lift well enclosure to allow safe and easy access to the parts of the safety gears for their maintenance and repairs; safety gears provided shall be in accordance with good practices.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.2',NULL,1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024689"]','3d178b69d7610ddaa33d5e41c4ed8120581f83b9ce629a52abe2f18923bd9185'),
('chunk-6379','GHBC-CHUNK-006379','GHBC-C-006379','31.1.4.10.1.3
Lift wells, together with the whole
of the contained equipment and apparatus, shall be rendered fire resistant to the greatest possible extent (see also Clause 31.1.4.4.1).',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.3','Lift wells, together with the whole',1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024690"]','7c0981311982756a1ba138d2da611a431c344c30438d620bd91dcde9a3bfdb2c'),
('chunk-6380','GHBC-CHUNK-006380','GHBC-C-006380','31.1.4.10.1.4
Every counterweight shall travel in juxtaposition to its car in the same lift well.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.4',NULL,1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024691"]','052a6aba6eb7f9cdb9c01cb68586a52bf6bcda0ec0d96d1359bf371ac04b48ba');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO "chunks" ("id", "chunk_id", "clause_id", "text", "part", "section", "clause", "title", "page", "tables_json", "requirement_ids_json", "source_hash") VALUES ('chunk-6381','GHBC-CHUNK-006381','GHBC-C-006381','31.1.4.10.1.5
It is undesirable that any room,
passage or thoroughfare be permitted under any lift well.  If unavoidable, spaces for other uses may be permitted under the lift well, with the prior approval of the Lift Inspectorate Authority and the following provisions shall be made;
a)  spring or oil buffers shall be provided for the lift car and counterweight; b)  the pit shall be sufficiently strong to withstand successfully, the impact of the
lift car with rated load or the impact of the counterweight when either is descending at rated speed or at governor tripping speed; c) the car and the counterweight shall be
provided with a governor-operated
safety gear; and d) the forces required on the structure in the event of car buffering directly without safety gear application to be indicated in the general arrangement drawing.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.1.5','It is undesirable that any room,',1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024692","GHBC-REQ-024693","GHBC-REQ-024694","GHBC-REQ-024695","GHBC-REQ-024696","GHBC-REQ-024697"]','b0333b68652215ee8fe987597b8d566da210d49039e8da3e1d4a0aeafbf22109'),
('chunk-6382','GHBC-CHUNK-006382','GHBC-C-006382','31.1.4.10.2
Lift well enclosures',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2','Lift well enclosures',1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','[]','5fdd602eb03f3ef511b905c1fbadebd3363cdf76a58bf6f64a4abd191f2cea35'),
('chunk-6383','GHBC-CHUNK-006383','GHBC-C-006383','31.1.4.10.2.1
Lift well enclosures shall be provided and shall extend on all sides from floorto-floor or stair-to-stair, and shall have requisite strength and in proper plumb.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.1',NULL,1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024698"]','a559ded401ab805b4f5602275a95c5739736e16f401f54698fe7ecfd1043f421'),
('chunk-6384','GHBC-CHUNK-006384','GHBC-C-006384','31.1.4.10.2.2
The inner sides of the lift well
enclosures facing any car entrance shall, as far as practicable, form a smooth, continuous flush surface devoid of projections or recesses. Note – This requirement may be met in existing lift wells by filling any recesses or spaces between projections or alternatively by covering them with suitable sheet material.  If it is not possible to render flush any objection or tops of recesses, they should be beveled on the underside to an angle of 600, from the horizontal by means of metal plates, cement rendering or other fire-resisting materials.  Where a car-levelling device is operative with car door opening, such interior surfaces shall always form a smooth flush surface below each landing level for a depth to at least the depth of the car-levelling zone plus the distance through which the lift car may travel of its own momentum when the power is cutoff.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.2','The inner sides of the lift well',1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024699","GHBC-REQ-024700","GHBC-REQ-024701","GHBC-REQ-024702"]','925516408714d7515c26f31bb93f200d08690ac8aaa846f0ef6a9bcd1f1ac207'),
('chunk-6385','GHBC-CHUNK-006385','GHBC-C-006385','31.1.4.10.2.3
Where an open lift well would
increase the fire risk in a building, the lift well enclosure shall be of fire-resisting construction see Part 3 Use and Occupancy classification
31.1.4.10.2.4 Where wire grill or similar constructions is used, the mesh or opening shall be such that the opening between the bars shall reject the ball of 40 mm in diameter and the lift well enclosure shall be of sufficient strength to resist accidental impact by users of the staircase on adjoining floors or by materials or trucks being moved in the vicinity.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.3','Where an open lift well would',1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024703","GHBC-REQ-024704"]','b1c0e6ee92bc9a1c124b88dfb2f0c041cc1a803627e04c665cfbf170a33eaefb'),
('chunk-6386','GHBC-CHUNK-006386','GHBC-C-006386','31.1.4.10.2.5
Where the clearance between the inside of an open-type lift well enclosure and any moving or movable part of the lift equipment of apparatus is less than 55 mm, the openings in the enclosure shall be further protected by netting of square mesh of aperture not greater than one centimeter and of wire not smaller than one mm.  (The provisions of this clause need not be adhered to for lift wells in factory premises, coming under the purview of Factories Act.  In such cases provisions of Clause 31.1.4.10.2.4 are sufficient).',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.5',NULL,1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024705","GHBC-REQ-024706","GHBC-REQ-024707"]','ef14c9f672ae4cdea0b662312a798e6f5c3c6335e412d9399794067c8f404f96'),
('chunk-6387','GHBC-CHUNK-006387','GHBC-C-006387','31.1.4.10.2.6
There shall be no opening in the lift well enclosure permitting access to the lift car by passing under the counterweight.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.6',NULL,1304,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024708"]','8a8bf4deebd6e6fe7f5532d52684b8ec47ea78bba7905181887a9c1cc3979276'),
('chunk-6388','GHBC-CHUNK-006388','GHBC-C-006388','31.1.4.10.2.7
In case of a completely enclosed
lift well, a notice with the word ‗Lift‘ may be placed outside of each landing door.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.7','In case of a completely enclosed',1305,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024709"]','38f1df962f2f7f7129439a88204c8d888ef7383af83a0efd628bbf168dffd977'),
('chunk-6389','GHBC-CHUNK-006389','GHBC-C-006389','31.1.4.10.2.8
Indicator
Where lifts are installed in totally enclosed wells, position indicators are recommended to be provided at each floor, however, where position indicators are not provided, at least direction indicators or ‗In Use‘ indicators shall be provided at each landing.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.8','Indicator',1305,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024710"]','3cda9da008ba229792579b25e483c54ec620f04e031f5bcb6d535953bd403bf1'),
('chunk-6390','GHBC-CHUNK-006390','GHBC-C-006390','9.5.4.10.2.9
Landing doors
Every lift well shall, on each side from which there is access to a car, be fitted with a door. Such a door shall be fitted with efficient electro mechanical locking so as to ensure that it cannot be opened except when the lift car is at landing and that the lift car cannot be moved away from the landing until the door is closed and locked. If the door is mechanically locked, means should be provided for opening the same by means of special key during emergency or inspection.',31,NULL,'9.5.4.10.2.9','Landing doors',1305,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024711","GHBC-REQ-024712","GHBC-REQ-024713"]','9262feb2acfd87c72f2c2c4339205e61519be895974cb32a4b346a666d69474a');
