Automatic devices for cutting
off power An efficient automatic device shall be provided and maintained in each lift whereby all powershall be cut off from the motor before the car or counterweight lands on buffer.',31,NULL,'31.1.4.10.2.10','Automatic devices for cutting',1305,'["Table 1:  Recommended dimensions of passenger lifts and service lifts","Table 1 – Concluded","Table 1A:   Recommended dimensions of pit, overhead and machine-room","Table 1 and 1A","Table 2","Table 3","Table 1 and 1A","Table 4","Table 2:  Recommended dimensions of goods lifts for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 3: Recommended dimensions of hospital lifts (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)","Table 4:  Recommended dimensions of dumb waiter (for speeds up to 0.5 m/s)"]','["GHBC-REQ-024714"]','bfa5e6f26e90804a8a3e3cade25d07b9469fab5357929c5c812467a174f8067a'),
('chunk-6392','GHBC-CHUNK-006392','GHBC-C-006392','31.1.4.10.3
