than 2.3m within the required area measured between wall faces or a wall face and a built-in cabinet or appliance.',35,'35.2','35.4.3.1','Living room area',1346,'["Table 35.3.2.A – Minimum design imposed","Table 35.3.5.A – Maximum deflection of","Table 35.4.2.A – Ceiling heights","Table 35.5.3A - Doorway sizes","Table 35.5.6.A – Glass size for Doors","Table 35.6.2.A","Table 35.6.3.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025665"]','bfa0dfc09c59eae1000fd9b6916dc48a9874dd8266755e7d05be621c8a4d6b28'),
