('chunk-6744','GHBC-CHUNK-006744','GHBC-C-006744','35.4.5.1
Kitchen area
Kitchen areas within dwelling units either separate or in combination with other space shall have at least 7.5m2 of floor area including the area occupied by the base cabinets, except that in bachelor dwelling units the minimum floor area shall be 4.0m2.',35,'35.2','35.4.5.1','Kitchen area',1347,'["Table 35.3.2.A – Minimum design imposed","Table 35.3.5.A – Maximum deflection of","Table 35.4.2.A – Ceiling heights","Table 35.5.3A - Doorway sizes","Table 35.5.6.A – Glass size for Doors","Table 35.6.2.A","Table 35.6.3.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025667"]','482398dba333f378989092eedb681937e934c339954686b978cfd5d917ca43dd'),
('chunk-6745','GHBC-CHUNK-006745','GHBC-C-006745','35.4.5.2
At least 910mm clearance shall be provided in front of base cabinet, work surfaces, counter tops and appliances.',35,'35.2','35.4.5.2',NULL,1347,'["Table 35.3.2.A – Minimum design imposed","Table 35.3.5.A – Maximum deflection of","Table 35.4.2.A – Ceiling heights","Table 35.5.3A - Doorway sizes","Table 35.5.6.A – Glass size for Doors","Table 35.6.2.A","Table 35.6.3.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025668"]','1cbf2eb3119f0d881b4b88d3c867724055df7515ad834aa3170dc3e020396ea8'),
('chunk-6746','GHBC-CHUNK-006746','GHBC-C-006746','35.4.6
