The minimum dimension within the required area shall be 2.44m.',35,'35.2','35.4.6.2','Other bedroom areas',1347,'["Table 35.3.2.A – Minimum design imposed","Table 35.3.5.A – Maximum deflection of","Table 35.4.2.A – Ceiling heights","Table 35.5.3A - Doorway sizes","Table 35.5.6.A – Glass size for Doors","Table 35.6.2.A","Table 35.6.3.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025671","GHBC-REQ-025672"]','8b7616594882d430b2b58751b6187340bfbdbb9d9c82fc38522624903b9db34e'),
