Bathroom areas
In every dwelling unit an enclosed space of a minimum of 3m2 shall be provided to accommodate a bathtub or shower bath, water closet and lavatory basin.
DGS 1207: 2018',35,'35.2','35.4.7.1','Bathroom areas',1347,'["Table 35.3.2.A – Minimum design imposed","Table 35.3.5.A – Maximum deflection of","Table 35.4.2.A – Ceiling heights","Table 35.5.3A - Doorway sizes","Table 35.5.6.A – Glass size for Doors","Table 35.6.2.A","Table 35.6.3.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025674","GHBC-REQ-025675"]','697c0db0b188c1a5431aaceaf0f67100ce880a3a8faaa573af50d83fc03f1757'),
