At least 550mm clearance shall be provided in front of the tub or shower stall to an opposite wall face or 450mm in front to another fixture over at least 600mm length of the bathtub or shower.',35,'35.2','35.4.7.2',NULL,1347,'["Table 35.3.2.A – Minimum design imposed","Table 35.3.5.A – Maximum deflection of","Table 35.4.2.A – Ceiling heights","Table 35.5.3A - Doorway sizes","Table 35.5.6.A – Glass size for Doors","Table 35.6.2.A","Table 35.6.3.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025676"]','06aea4ad9adb56cbc59d64e6888efffe62d992fc797c5c1fe234dd46e10d9288'),
