Minimum window glass area
Except as provided in 35.6.2.4 the minimum window glass area for rooms in buildings or residential occupancy or which are used for sleeping shall conform to Table 35.6.2.A.  The unobstructed glass area of a door or skylight is considered equivalent to that of a window.',35,'35.2','35.6.2.2','Minimum window glass area',1349,'["Table 35.3.2.A – Minimum design imposed","Table 35.3.5.A – Maximum deflection of","Table 35.4.2.A – Ceiling heights","Table 35.5.3A - Doorway sizes","Table 35.5.6.A – Glass size for Doors","Table 35.6.2.A","Table 35.6.3.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025707","GHBC-REQ-025708"]','3cbbd6c78a3c446fc9e0636b7dfa81cd062b989cb50ff42fb88518142f5450a2'),
('chunk-6779','GHBC-CHUNK-006779','GHBC-C-006779','35.6.2.3
