('chunk-6969','GHBC-CHUNK-006969','GHBC-C-006969','35.15.5.1
Material
Unit masonry columns shall be built of loadbearing masonry units.
DGS 1207: 2018',35,'35.15','35.15.5.1','Material',1365,'["Table 35.16.3.A","Table 35.16.9.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025939","GHBC-REQ-025940"]','ca19d32ad92b5187855f9c505defbf1e37149ce8278fb9433d3754c51a4fcb7f'),
('chunk-6970','GHBC-CHUNK-006970','GHBC-C-006970','35.15.5.2
