Unit masonry columns shall have minimum nominal dimensions of 300mm by 300mm or 250mm by 400mm.',35,'35.15','35.15.5.2','Size',1365,'["Table 35.16.3.A","Table 35.16.9.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025941"]','357ceb7ec5634450bbd7dbfe3cd46f5d3cc2f21c782b080595d39e7c9bb4805b');
