Concrete columns shall not be less than 200mm by 200mm for rectangular columns and 225 mm diameter for circular columns',35,'35.15','35.15.6.2','Size',1365,'["Table 35.16.3.A","Table 35.16.9.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025943"]','b93db71b6bd551e119ea2af81bf736c0f34234343c3f9b191ffb1252f8b9b0a3'),
