('chunk-6976','GHBC-CHUNK-006976','GHBC-C-006976','35.16.1.1
This Clause applies to unreinforced
masonry and masonry finish in which the wall above the foundation does not exceed 7.60m and in which the roof or floor system above the first storey is not of concrete construction.',35,'35.15','35.16.1.1','This Clause applies to unreinforced',1365,'["Table 35.16.3.A","Table 35.16.9.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025945"]','1decd80cf587448b1f56c1ce14ddfc82184365be533f1df8e93bc4e2fc24b77d'),
('chunk-6977','GHBC-CHUNK-006977','GHBC-C-006977','35.16.1.2
For buildings other than those
described in Article 35.16.1.1 or where the masonry is designed on the basis of design loads and allowable stresses, structural members of unreinforced masonry shall conform to Eurocode 6-Design of unreinforced structures.',35,'35.15','35.16.1.2','For buildings other than those',1365,'["Table 35.16.3.A","Table 35.16.9.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025946"]','b10072cf5798b0c5bbadf1a550878c38afa207187f8b2e5c0dfced81d4e2c622'),
('chunk-6978','GHBC-CHUNK-006978','GHBC-C-006978','35.16.1.3
In Seismic Zone 3, loadbearing
elements of masonry buildings more than one storey in height shall be reinforced with at least the minimum amount of reinforcement as required in Subclause 35.16.11.',35,'35.15','35.16.1.3','In Seismic Zone 3, loadbearing',1365,'["Table 35.16.3.A","Table 35.16.9.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025947"]','150dd261d3d31894cebe33471e5e18696e1b302358429f9c2a386366932be3fc'),
('chunk-6979','GHBC-CHUNK-006979','GHBC-C-006979','35.16.1.4
In Seismic Zone 2, loadbearing
elements of three storey masonry building shall be reinforced with at least the minimum amount of reinforcement as required in Subclause 35.16.11.',35,'35.15','35.16.1.4','In Seismic Zone 2, loadbearing',1365,'["Table 35.16.3.A","Table 35.16.9.A"]','["GHBC-REQ-025948"]','8aeb86c011d582513cc70ec9e5d8fe1ac3eb15e3a455b23d9f9f047117e51589'),
('chunk-6980','GHBC-CHUNK-006980','GHBC-C-006980','35.16.2
