Where a public sewage system is
not available, the building sewer shall discharge into a private sewage disposal system such as a septic tank and disposal field provided the design and installation is approved.',35,'35.19','35.22.4.3','Where a public sewage system is',1377,'["Table 35.19.3A","Table 35.19.5A","Table 35.19.6A","Table 35.19.6A","Table 35.20.3A","Table 35.21.2.1","Table 35.21.2B"]','["GHBC-REQ-026162"]','6fa156f8dac16347301a36f60f5632cee168b918f501a92c4124e20843a39e3f'),
