('chunk-7153','GHBC-CHUNK-007153','GHBC-C-007153','35.23.1.1
This clause applies to the ventilation
of rooms and spaces in residential occupancies but does not apply to the ventilations of rooms intended to be used for the lawful detention of any person other than a mentally disordered person.',35,'35.23','35.23.1.1','This clause applies to the ventilation',1377,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-026163"]','98200cf7f870cc7e7022c682ffa1249c64b4f92efd51fe3fd1867607331f4778'),
