('chunk-7157','GHBC-CHUNK-007157','GHBC-C-007157','35.23.2.1
Except as provided in Article
35.23.2.3 any habitable room shall (unless it is adequately ventilated by mechanical means) have one or more ventilation openings so constructed that:
i. their total area is equal to not less than 15% of the floor area of the room; and ii. some part of such area is not less than 1.75m above the floor.',35,'35.23','35.23.2.1','Except as provided in Article',1377,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-026166","GHBC-REQ-026167"]','5c42674465fcc986b7d43fc6664461ebe65e3eb15f5d02f1efe3070e7718f4fc'),
('chunk-7158','GHBC-CHUNK-007158','GHBC-C-007158','35.23.2.2
A door which opens directly to the external air shall be deemed to be a ventilation opening if:
DGS 1207: 2018
i. such door contains a ventilator with an area of not less than 10,000mm2 capable of being opened (without the door being opened); or
ii. the room contains one or more ventilation openings having a total area of not less than 10,000mm2; in addition to such door.',35,'35.23','35.23.2.2',NULL,1377,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-026168","GHBC-REQ-026169","GHBC-REQ-026170","GHBC-REQ-026171"]','b9edffc731e0db53ecf559b2166c1933322aaabe21efd7b07e95ea5464ae22a6'),
('chunk-7159','GHBC-CHUNK-007159','GHBC-C-007159','35.23.2.3
A habitable room opening into an enclosed verandah, conservatory or similar place shall be deemed to comply with the provisions of this regulation if such room and such enclosed place together have one or more ventilation openings which, if they ventilated a room having a floor area equal to the combined floor areas of such habitable room and such enclosed space would comply with the requirements of Article 35.23.2.1.',35,'35.23','35.23.2.3',NULL,1377,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-026172"]','ade4a8b40c0acdab732b3ffe09ea777e8be4cc7b519bbe7b14afea7b1b0f1504'),
('chunk-7160','GHBC-CHUNK-007160','GHBC-C-007160','35.23.3
