('chunk-7166','GHBC-CHUNK-007166','GHBC-C-007166','35.23.5.1
Any part of a stairway which is
intended for common use within any building constructed for occupation as separate dwellings by more than one family and above the ground storey and not open to the external air shall have adequate means of ventilation.',35,'35.23','35.23.5.1','Any part of a stairway which is',1378,'[]','["GHBC-REQ-026189"]','dc4755643dc8cf504c7e1ca32b6130811ccfd689aee627d71a1ff3875d0a35ba'),
('chunk-7167','GHBC-CHUNK-007167','GHBC-C-007167','35.24.1
